## Budget Allocation & Testing Rules for Dropshippers

When launching a new dropshipping product:
- **Never spend more than $50 testing a creative concept**.
- Deploy **3 ad variations with different hooks** into a TikTok CBO (Campaign Budget Optimization) ad set at $50/day.
- After 1,000 impressions (typically 2-3 hours):
  - If **3-Second Hook Rate is < 25%**, kill immediately.
  - If **Cost Per Add-to-Cart (ATC) is > 50% of your product profit margin**, kill.
  - If a variant achieves **ROAS > 2.5x with Hook Rate > 35%**, duplicate the ad set with 5x budget and use Motion Studio to generate 5 more hook variations of that winning concept.

